{"v":4,"catch":"新人類的曙光－生物能源！\n人類終於用PSYCHO GUN反擊了！","desc":"《Mighty Guy》是Nichibutsu於1986年發行的動作遊戲。\n使用你的PSYCHO GUN以及諸如拳擊、踢腿和光束等超人動作來打倒敵人，並阻止大型超級電腦“ZELDA”的轉基因人類和統治世界的計劃！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-01-04","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0586cfa1e52b26801bf3c97ac17c6e47ca04591740343247c32dc31dbc7d7b83.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/50cae964e02d3608aada3c7bc0a2d023501cb80f46b5b3ebed2c18622739df8d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6d967f47421d15680081f24dda2b5da46c8eb97be9c4e809b596128e2fe926a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ca3c1166ac339f20a3c5319cd2fb845578d30e9a11b6b442a3b2d382af7a67df.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ccc8be18d671cfff131a606187f6f5098ce4b8075e23a1b2914f73b0675d05b4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b244b5dcbba2c8813391ecd59c1034df85026ab3ebffa88b1d3f86a0023e99a9.jpg"],"titleId":"010058101c706000","dlc":[]}